{"name": "Heroes Of Isekai", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroes Of Isekai is an auto-battler with roguelike elements. Choose your hero first, then run your camp \u2014 will you buy a gold mine to invest in the future, or boost your strength right away? Allocate gold and food wisely, hire units of different races, and purchase buildings and spells. Every choice you make leads to a completely different strategic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/d0721e34b652df9fd6aa2d9b09ba7bf0.webp?t=1790662755\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"310\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/d0721e34b652df9fd6aa2d9b09ba7bf0.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/5ada29f507566c7a3104df6a8b75d65d.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/5ada29f507566c7a3104df6a8b75d65d.webm?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/5ada29f507566c7a3104df6a8b75d65d.mp4?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your camp is the heart of every run. Buildings, spells, runes, and creatures appear randomly in the card pool. Spend your gold, set your direction, and shape your hero and army however you see fit. Runes are the soul of your build: some grant bonuses outright, while the most powerful ones only activate when hidden conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/ea47f96f5442659a344af1e8d39e7380.webp?t=1790662755\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"310\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/ea47f96f5442659a344af1e8d39e7380.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/4848f353eb138b90f5b04a15a7aabce5.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/4848f353eb138b90f5b04a15a7aabce5.webm?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/4848f353eb138b90f5b04a15a7aabce5.mp4?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble your legion and dive into auto-battles! Empower your army with magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/6113cb78340badaa69b7809fb781e6f0.webp?t=1790662755\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"310\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/6113cb78340badaa69b7809fb781e6f0.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/7db19087cdfa23abb96e586ab5459661.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/7db19087cdfa23abb96e586ab5459661.webm?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/7db19087cdfa23abb96e586ab5459661.mp4?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Abyss never ceases its assault. Fight endless waves of abyssal monsters, adjust your build on the fly, and push further in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2ce2f3af29fa35acea09c5feacc85a8c.webp?t=1790662755\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"310\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/2ce2f3af29fa35acea09c5feacc85a8c.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/f5c349ce92b3cfaed26c8f87f3675d34.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/f5c349ce92b3cfaed26c8f87f3675d34.webm?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/f5c349ce92b3cfaed26c8f87f3675d34.mp4?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend mana to unleash spells of water, fire, earth, wind, and more \u2014 call down lightning, empower your entire army, or freeze every enemy in place to turn the tide of battle. A well-crafted spell build is powerful enough to shatter the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/faea83669c7a2295bc40decb3669151c.webp?t=1790662755\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"310\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/faea83669c7a2295bc40decb3669151c.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/5874fbf05ce8a300cf4e16fbf350379f.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/5874fbf05ce8a300cf4e16fbf350379f.webm?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/5874fbf05ce8a300cf4e16fbf350379f.mp4?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipment directly boosts your hero's stats. Visit the blacksmith and forge legendary gear, so your hero can stand against a hundred foes and sweep through entire armies \u2014 it's time to go full Musou mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/f93376f42896a5f8b3036940b1cada34.webp?t=1790662755\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"310\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/f93376f42896a5f8b3036940b1cada34.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/c902909933b32fa2db3610268735a7a2.poster.avif?t=1790662755\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/c902909933b32fa2db3610268735a7a2.webm?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/c902909933b32fa2db3610268735a7a2.mp4?t=1790662755\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather as many resources as you can on each expedition, and invest in permanent town upgrades. Even in defeat, you'll come back stronger \u2014 the outcome is far from decided!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "An auto-battler with roguelike elements, and no unit cap. Run your camp, buy creatures, buildings, spells, gear and runes, assemble your build \u2014 then crush your enemies!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/dd6704fb1f9e8c1b5005627b5f02a3db1ceab165/header.jpg?t=1790662755", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "Roguelike", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Base Building", "Roguelite", "Turn-Based Tactics"], "developers": "FlashDrill", "publishers": "FlashDrill", "release_date": "Q2 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2676290", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "28 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/--jMgUopCgU", "first_seen": 1790546400.0, "review_rank": 48}